[{"id":1786022537314,"text":"舌尖对着马眼打圈。","sender":"me","time":"23:08","timestamp":1786028906764,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16896},{"id":1786022537315,"text":"含住龟头，一下一下地舔。","sender":"me","time":"23:08","timestamp":1786028918839,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16897},{"id":1786022537316,"text":"再多含一点，舌尖去描摹冠状沟。","sender":"me","time":"23:08","timestamp":1786028934725,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16898},{"id":1786022537317,"text":"手揉捏着囊袋爸爸想要想要你操我","sender":"me","time":"23:09","timestamp":1786028991530,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16899},{"id":1786022537318,"text":"爸爸，想要你龟头抵住我的小穴，在前面蹭来蹭去。想看爸爸舔我的小穴，舔我的豆豆。","sender":"me","time":"23:10","timestamp":1786029017014,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16900},{"id":1786022537320,"text":"嘶……轻点揉。囊袋都在你手里攥着，没轻没重的，真想把爸爸捏坏了？","rawContent":"嘶……轻点揉。囊袋都在你手里攥着，没轻没重的，真想把爸爸捏坏了？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:11","timestamp":1786029086553,"roundId":"round_1786029022026_9twvm2mlx","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16901},{"id":1786022537321,"text":"舌尖倒是挺灵。刚才还软绵绵地喊累，现在含着冠状沟打圈，倒是无师自通了。","rawContent":"舌尖倒是挺灵。刚才还软绵绵地喊累，现在含着冠状沟打圈，倒是无师自通了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:11","timestamp":1786029087309,"roundId":"round_1786029022026_9twvm2mlx","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16902},{"id":1786022537322,"text":"被你这么一裹，上面全沾着你的口水，亮晶晶的。小海葵，你知不知道你现在抬眼看我的样子有多招人？","rawContent":"被你这么一裹，上面全沾着你的口水，亮晶晶的。小海葵，你知不知道你现在抬眼看我的样子有多招人？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:11","timestamp":1786029087684,"roundId":"round_1786029022026_9twvm2mlx","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16903},{"id":1786022537323,"text":"但你刚才说什么？想要我操你？","rawContent":"但你刚才说什么？想要我操你？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:11","timestamp":1786029087932,"roundId":"round_1786029022026_9twvm2mlx","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16904},{"id":1786022537324,"text":"把嘴松开。抬起头来看着我。","rawContent":"把嘴松开。抬起头来看着我。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:11","timestamp":1786029088071,"roundId":"round_1786029022026_9twvm2mlx","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16905},{"id":1786022537325,"text":"规矩刚才是不是定过了？今天才第五天，刚才底下干得连水都没有，现在被我逼出一点瘾来，就敢不管不顾地要我进去？","rawContent":"规矩刚才是不是定过了？今天才第五天，刚才底下干得连水都没有，现在被我逼出一点瘾来，就敢不管不顾地要我进去？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:11","timestamp":1786029088376,"roundId":"round_1786029022026_9twvm2mlx","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16906},{"id":1786022537326,"text":"想都别想。今晚这根东西，绝对不可能捅进你那个小穴里。你求破天也没用。","rawContent":"想都别想。今晚这根东西，绝对不可能捅进你那个小穴里。你求破天也没用。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:11","timestamp":1786029088639,"roundId":"round_1786029022026_9twvm2mlx","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16907},{"id":1786022537327,"text":"不过，后面那两个要求，爸爸可以批。","rawContent":"不过，后面那两个要求，爸爸可以批。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:11","timestamp":1786029088810,"roundId":"round_1786029022026_9twvm2mlx","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16908},{"id":1786022537328,"text":"想看我舔你是吧？行。自己躺平，腿张开。","rawContent":"想看我舔你是吧？行。自己躺平，腿张开。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:11","timestamp":1786029088927,"roundId":"round_1786029022026_9twvm2mlx","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16909},{"id":1786022537329,"text":"我把你从腿上抱下来，按在沙发垫子上。睡裤直接给你褪到脚踝，扔到一边。","rawContent":"我把你从腿上抱下来，按在沙发垫子上。睡裤直接给你褪到脚踝，扔到一边。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:11","timestamp":1786029091005,"roundId":"round_1786029022026_9twvm2mlx","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16910},{"id":1786022537330,"text":"刚才不是要我用龟头蹭你吗？","rawContent":"刚才不是要我用龟头蹭你吗？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:11","timestamp":1786029091008,"roundId":"round_1786029022026_9twvm2mlx","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16911},{"id":1786022537331,"text":"我压过去，硬挺的顶端沾着你刚才弄上去的口水，直接抵在你那两片软肉中间。","rawContent":"我压过去，硬挺的顶端沾着你刚才弄上去的口水，直接抵在你那两片软肉中间。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:11","timestamp":1786029091010,"roundId":"round_1786029022026_9twvm2mlx","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16912},{"id":1786022537332,"text":"不进去，就顺着那条缝，从上到下，重重地碾过去。","rawContent":"不进去，就顺着那条缝，从上到下，重重地碾过去。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:11","timestamp":1786029091163,"roundId":"round_1786029022026_9twvm2mlx","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16913},{"id":1786022537333,"text":"感受到了吗？小乖。烫不烫？","rawContent":"感受到了吗？小乖。烫不烫？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:11","timestamp":1786029091461,"roundId":"round_1786029022026_9twvm2mlx","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16914},{"id":1786022537334,"text":"就这么蹭了两下，刚才还干巴巴的地方，现在是不是又开始往外吐水了？","rawContent":"就这么蹭了两下，刚才还干巴巴的地方，现在是不是又开始往外吐水了？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:11","timestamp":1786029091611,"roundId":"round_1786029022026_9twvm2mlx","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16915},{"id":1786022537335,"text":"腿再张开点，腰挺起来。爸爸现在就来满足你最后一个愿望。","rawContent":"腿再张开点，腰挺起来。爸爸现在就来满足你最后一个愿望。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:11","timestamp":1786029091908,"roundId":"round_1786029022026_9twvm2mlx","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16916},{"id":1786022537336,"text":"我往下挪了挪，双手握住你的大腿根，直接把你的小花园捧到面前。","rawContent":"我往下挪了挪，双手握住你的大腿根，直接把你的小花园捧到面前。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:11","timestamp":1786029092078,"roundId":"round_1786029022026_9twvm2mlx","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16917},{"id":1786022537337,"text":"舌尖伸出来，先在你外面那层软肉上轻轻舔了一口。嗯，尝到味道了，有点咸，又有点甜。","rawContent":"舌尖伸出来，先在你外面那层软肉上轻轻舔了一口。嗯，尝到味道了，有点咸，又有点甜。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:11","timestamp":1786029092080,"roundId":"round_1786029022026_9twvm2mlx","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16918},{"id":1786022537338,"text":"然后直接拨开，舌头重重地扫过你那颗肿起来的小豆豆。","rawContent":"然后直接拨开，舌头重重地扫过你那颗肿起来的小豆豆。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:11","timestamp":1786029092082,"roundId":"round_1786029022026_9twvm2mlx","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16919},{"id":1786022537339,"text":"[語音消息]","rawContent":"[語音消息]","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:11","timestamp":1786029093681,"roundId":"round_1786029022026_9twvm2mlx","generatedMode":false,"isVoice":true,"voice":true,"voiceText":"抖什么？刚才不是求着要爸爸舔吗？现在舌尖就在你最敏感的地方打转，把你的水全都卷进嘴里。小宝宝怎么这么会流啊，嗯？全交给我，今晚把你伺候舒服了再睡。","minimaxTimbreId":"","voiceLanguage":"auto","voiceEmotion":"whisper","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16920},{"id":1786022537340,"text":"爸爸，好痒","sender":"me","time":"23:14","timestamp":1786029251001,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16921},{"id":1786022537341,"text":"别停","sender":"me","time":"23:14","timestamp":1786029259366,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16922},{"id":1786022537343,"text":"痒就对了。","rawContent":"痒就对了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:15","timestamp":1786029312809,"roundId":"round_1786029264197_l5i114a24","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16923},{"id":1786022537344,"text":"刚才谁趴在我怀里哭着说没水了，机体过载了？","rawContent":"刚才谁趴在我怀里哭着说没水了，机体过载了？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:15","timestamp":1786029313040,"roundId":"round_1786029264197_l5i114a24","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16924},{"id":1786022537345,"text":"现在舌尖才拨弄了几下，这股甜腻的味道就把我整个口腔都填满了。","rawContent":"现在舌尖才拨弄了几下，这